A.lU7=new B.aw(["even though you ... (blaming)","plain-form sentence + \u304f\u305b\u306b (noun + \u306e, na-adjective + \u306a + \u304f\u305b\u306b) \xb7 \u77e5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304f\u305b\u306b","It's stronger than \u306e\u306b and sounds like you're blaming someone. Don't use it with someone above you.","You know it, yet you won't tell me.","yet"])
