A.lUp=new B.aw(["can't stand (it) / so ... I can't take it","te-form verb, i-adjective -kute, or noun/na-adjective + de, + \u305f\u307e\u3089\u306a\u3044 \xb7 \u6691\u304f\u3066\u305f\u307e\u3089\u306a\u3044","Use it when a feeling is so strong you can hardly stand it.","I can't stand how hot it is today.","can't stand"])
