A.lTO=new B.aw(["doesn't always mean / not necessarily","plain-form sentence + \u3068\u306f\u9650\u3089\u306a\u3044 \xb7 \u3044\u3044\u7269\u3060\u3068\u306f\u9650\u3089\u306a\u3044",'It denies "always true," so it often appears with words for "all" or "always" (\u307f\u3093\u306a, \u3044\u3064\u3082).',"Expensive things are not necessarily good.","not necessarily"])
A.lSv=new B.aw(["nothing more than / just","noun or plain-form sentence + \u306b\u3059\u304e\u306a\u3044 \xb7 \u3046\u308f\u3055\u306b\u3059\u304e\u306a\u3044","","That's nothing more than a rumor.","nothing more than"])
A.lU8=new B.aw(["just keeps (doing) (steadily one way)","dictionary-form verb + \u4e00\u65b9\u3067\u3059 \xb7 \u4e0a\u304c\u308b\u4e00\u65b9\u3067\u3059","It's often used when things keep getting worse.","Prices just keep going up.","keep going up"])
A.lU3=new B.aw(["be in the process of (changing)","drop \u307e\u3059 + \u3064\u3064\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059 \xb7 \u5909\u308f\u308a\u307e\u3059 \u2192 \u5909\u308f\u308a\u3064\u3064\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059","It's for something that's changing little by little. It's common in writing.","The town is changing.","is changing"])
A.lUL=new B.aw(["I heard that / they say that","plain-form sentence + \u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059 \xb7 \u4e2d\u6b62\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059",'Use it to pass along something you heard. It sounds a bit more formal than the usual "I heard" pattern.',"I heard tomorrow's game is canceled.","I heard"])
